No doubt, Excalibur.  a +0 Excalibur is better than a +0 Stormbringer.

Why:  Stormbringer is less effective against undead.
      Broadswords do less damage than long swords against large critters.
      Stormbringer drains levels.  (Bad if you want the intrinsic
      that that critter has.  Intrinsic transference depends on the critter
      level.)

If you don't care about drain-level protection, though, go for Mjollnir.

